(6930554, 1044835, 138253, '<td valign="top">Looks like a carousel at night. The floating Noel sign is a bit odd in it''s placement, it doesn''t look like it''s being sucked away in the swirling vortex of light, but it''s pointed that way anyways. perhaps a bit small overall to the frame and straight on would help improve this compositionally?</td>', 'Looks like a carousel at night. The floating Noel sign is a bit odd in it''s placement, it doesn''t look like it''s being sucked away in the swirling vortex of light, but it''s pointed that way anyways. perhaps a bit small overall to the frame and straight on would help improve this compositionally?', '2012-12-12 00:43:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6930555, 1044846, 138253, '<td valign="top">Cute model - i recognize her from the autumn photoshoot you had linked in the forums before - i''m sure your daughter will love having these pictures in the future!<br/>The backdrop is great, i''m curious if it''s a drop or just hanging lights - i''m looking to get a similarly colored dropcloth with a light pattern like this (but fully wide spread for the lights). If this is a backdrop, i''d love to hear where you got it from.</td>', 'Cute model - i recognize her from the autumn photoshoot you had linked in the forums before - i''m sure your daughter will love having these pictures in the future!The backdrop is great, i''m curious if it''s a drop or just hanging lights - i''m looking to get a similarly colored dropcloth with a light pattern like this (but fully wide spread for the lights). If this is a backdrop, i''d love to hear where you got it from.', '2012-12-12 00:44:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6930556, 1044893, 138253, '<td valign="top">First thing i noticed in this image was the PJ''s - my son has the identical set.<br/>I''d like to see a bit more lighting from the left side. Santa seems fully illuminated from the left but nothing else is - that''s a bit distracting, as are the shadowy ornament/stocking.<br/>Overall nice image, but keeping lighting equal is key (as i''ve been reminded of in my own entries time and time again).</td>', 'First thing i noticed in this image was the PJ''s - my son has the identical set.I''d like to see a bit more lighting from the left side. Santa seems fully illuminated from the left but nothing else is - that''s a bit distracting, as are the shadowy ornament/stocking.Overall nice image, but keeping lighting equal is key (as i''ve been reminded of in my own entries time and time again).', '2012-12-12 00:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6930590, 1044768, 30712, '<td valign="top">For me there''s rather too much blur in this image for it to have the impact it deserves.  I''d appreciate a bit more eye contact with your animal friend even if they''re closed.</td>', 'For me there''s rather too much blur in this image for it to have the impact it deserves.  I''d appreciate a bit more eye contact with your animal friend even if they''re closed.', '2012-12-12 02:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
