(6930630, 1044896, 28742, '<td valign="top"><strike>Woops - I don''t think there was an exception for allowing text. Pretty cool without it though.</strike> I stand corrected. In any case, I think the text hurts this a little bit. Still it''s worth a <strike>6</strike>. <b>7</b> (Merry Christmas!) :)</td>', 'Woops - I don''t think there was an exception for allowing text. Pretty cool without it though. I stand corrected. In any case, I think the text hurts this a little bit. Still it''s worth a 6. 7 (Merry Christmas!) :)', '2012-12-12 04:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
