(6937113, 1044841, 138630, '<td valign="top">Wonderful work - definitely comes across as "real" until you start looking for the inevitable "I forgot to turn my light on" rooms LOL  And if the lighting IS real, I am just as impressed :)  Glad to know you are recovering well enough from the surgery to participate.  Congratulations on the top ten.</td>', 'Wonderful work - definitely comes across as "real" until you start looking for the inevitable "I forgot to turn my light on" rooms LOL  And if the lighting IS real, I am just as impressed :)  Glad to know you are recovering well enough from the surgery to participate.  Congratulations on the top ten.', '2012-12-19 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 0),
