(6937124, 1044910, 77196, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a great picture - the high key look, white vignetting, the splashes of color from the ornaments, and the stark contrast of the cat. You even did a great job with the text script and color. Submit it to Hallmark - it is that good.</td>', 'I thought this was a great picture - the high key look, white vignetting, the splashes of color from the ornaments, and the stark contrast of the cat. You even did a great job with the text script and color. Submit it to Hallmark - it is that good.', '2012-12-19 09:01:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937126, 1044885, 77196, '<td valign="top">Stunningly beautiful and masterfully done.</td>', 'Stunningly beautiful and masterfully done.', '2012-12-19 09:04:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937128, 1044897, 77196, '<td valign="top">Why focus on the negative? You got 42 votes above 6, and 14 above 7. Personally, I think the Grinch stopped by just to vote on your shot. <br/>There wasn''t enough context for me to really understand the text, which kind-of left it unresolved. Great concept and well executed. (and no, I am not the Grinch, or one of his minions).</td>', 'Why focus on the negative? You got 42 votes above 6, and 14 above 7. Personally, I think the Grinch stopped by just to vote on your shot. There wasn''t enough context for me to really understand the text, which kind-of left it unresolved. Great concept and well executed. (and no, I am not the Grinch, or one of his minions).', '2012-12-19 09:10:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937130, 1044846, 11854, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your first ribbon! She''s such a doll!</td>', 'Congrats on your first ribbon! She''s such a doll!', '2012-12-19 09:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
