(6937308, 1044846, 118503, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the kind words. To answer Ryan''s question, the lights are a combination of net lights and string lights. Here''s a BTS shot:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/kevingeary/8287326405/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//farm9.staticflickr.com/8500/8287326405_e9315fb502.jpg'', strrpos(''//farm9.staticflickr.com/8500/8287326405_e9315fb502.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//farm9.staticflickr.com/8500/8287326405_e9315fb502.jpg"/></a> <br/><a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/kevingeary/8287326405/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Behind the Scenes of Christmas Card Shoot</a> by <a href="//www.flickr.com/people/kevingeary/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">kevingeary</a>, on Flickr<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thank you all for the kind words. To answer Ryan''s question, the lights are a combination of net lights and string lights. Here''s a BTS shot:  Behind the Scenes of Christmas Card Shoot by kevingeary, on Flickr ', '2012-12-19 11:34:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937346, 1044897, 155317, '<td valign="top">I personally love it, nicely done!</td>', 'I personally love it, nicely done!', '2012-12-19 12:28:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937349, 1044199, 30861, '<td valign="top">Truly a masterpiece. Seriously.</td>', 'Truly a masterpiece. Seriously.', '2012-12-19 12:30:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937362, 1044897, 109387, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by dtremain:</b></div><hr/><i> Why focus on the negative? You got 42 votes above 6, and 14 above 7. Personally, I think the Grinch stopped by just to vote on your shot. <br/>There wasn''t enough context for me to really understand the text, which kind-of left it unresolved. Great concept and well executed. (and no, I am not the Grinch, or one of his minions). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for the comment :)<br/> <br/>I was not focusing on the low votes, I was trying to analyze the voting pattern. When I get so many low votes most of the times the image is not so good in terms of quality or it''s DNMC. Assuming that this is not DNMC I thought that people, not seeing something like ''Merry Christmas'' or ''Happy holidays'' could have penalized the image. Not complaining, just understanding :)</td>', 'Originally posted by dtremain: Why focus on the negative? You got 42 votes above 6, and 14 above 7. Personally, I think the Grinch stopped by just to vote on your shot. There wasn''t enough context for me to really understand the text, which kind-of left it unresolved. Great concept and well executed. (and no, I am not the Grinch, or one of his minions).   Thanks for the comment :) I was not focusing on the low votes, I was trying to analyze the voting pattern. When I get so many low votes most of the times the image is not so good in terms of quality or it''s DNMC. Assuming that this is not DNMC I thought that people, not seeing something like ''Merry Christmas'' or ''Happy holidays'' could have penalized the image. Not complaining, just understanding :)', '2012-12-19 12:36:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937365, 1044926, 155317, '<td valign="top">love this, nicely done!</td>', 'love this, nicely done!', '2012-12-19 12:40:32.000000', NULL, 0),
