(6937379, 1044841, 117534, '<td valign="top">OOOPS like Art.. I failed to read the description... Hey I was just getting back to life over the flu, so shoot me... I gave it a 9 and guess I''m gonna have to turn in my DNMC Nazzi membership along with Art!!! But I still love it!! I''d send it as a card ANY DAY !!!</td>', 'OOOPS like Art.. I failed to read the description... Hey I was just getting back to life over the flu, so shoot me... I gave it a 9 and guess I''m gonna have to turn in my DNMC Nazzi membership along with Art!!! But I still love it!! I''d send it as a card ANY DAY !!!', '2012-12-19 12:49:05.000000', NULL, 0),
