(6937686, 1044846, 119012, '<td valign="top">how did you get the beautiful bokeh out of the 50/1.4???</td>', 'how did you get the beautiful bokeh out of the 50/1.4???', '2012-12-19 20:20:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6937725, 1044846, 118503, '<td valign="top">@mike -- it''s just subject to background distance. the 50mm 1.4 produces beautiful bokeh anyway, but it''s certainly helped a lot by the distance between subject and background. <br/> <br/>In the BTS shot, she''s closer to the lights than she was when I actually took the image. For the real shot she was slightly passed the halfway point on the other side of the bed -- the side I shot from.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2012-12-19 21:33:10.</i></td>', '@mike -- it''s just subject to background distance. the 50mm 1.4 produces beautiful bokeh anyway, but it''s certainly helped a lot by the distance between subject and background.  In the BTS shot, she''s closer to the lights than she was when I actually took the image. For the real shot she was slightly passed the halfway point on the other side of the bed -- the side I shot from.', '2012-12-19 21:31:52.000000', '2012-12-19 21:33:10.000000', 0),
