(6938146, 1044898, 124190, '<td valign="top">It is a card....THE card I sent out this year to my friends. I live alone with my golden retriever Buddy.....WE are family. He is the model on my stamp.....  from a photo I took of him.... This was much more fun doing than it was being in this challenge. I drew my card, the pencil drawing from nikonjeb''s roof top apartment.  I wanted to share Christmas cheer.  Seems like not many sent it back....... or got the message....or even took the time to try to "get it". Oh wellll....lol!   <br/>Happy New Year.</td>', 'It is a card....THE card I sent out this year to my friends. I live alone with my golden retriever Buddy.....WE are family. He is the model on my stamp.....  from a photo I took of him.... This was much more fun doing than it was being in this challenge. I drew my card, the pencil drawing from nikonjeb''s roof top apartment.  I wanted to share Christmas cheer.  Seems like not many sent it back....... or got the message....or even took the time to try to "get it". Oh wellll....lol!   Happy New Year.', '2012-12-20 13:12:08.000000', NULL, 0),
