(6940873, 1044927, 68503, '<td valign="top">Thanks Lydia, I didnt save the raw files when I brought them into Lightroom becuase I converted to DNG. I guess Ill know next time to keep the files that I use for challenge entries. Dont understand why a dng wouldnt work considering it is out of the camera image and you can tell if it was edited. Oh well...</td>', 'Thanks Lydia, I didnt save the raw files when I brought them into Lightroom becuase I converted to DNG. I guess Ill know next time to keep the files that I use for challenge entries. Dont understand why a dng wouldnt work considering it is out of the camera image and you can tell if it was edited. Oh well...', '2012-12-23 18:44:45.000000', NULL, 0),
